message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "catatonia-two-axes: reproduction code for a dependency-ordered recovery geometry"
abstract: >-
  A single self-contained Python script that reproduces every numerical result,
  figure and source-data table of the paper, re-checks each reported number
  against the stored results at the precision printed, and renders the
  manuscript and Supplementary Information to Word.
